# Build context is the REPO ROOT (`docker build -f portal/Dockerfile .`),
# because the portal image bakes `terraform/` + `terraform/ansible/`, which
# live outside `portal/`. Keep the context small and keep secrets out.
#
# NOTE: `build.sh` builds the three submodule images with the *submodule* as
# context, so nothing here affects those builds.

# --- VCS ---
.git
.gitmodules

# --- Submodules (huge, not needed by the portal image) ---
headscale/
headplane/
tailscale/
tailscale-wincli/

# --- terraform: keep the MODULE (portal bakes *.tf + scripts/ + ansible/),
#     drop everything that is state, secrets, cache or generated ---
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/keys/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/terraform.tfvars
terraform/*.tfvars
!terraform/terraform.tfvars.example
terraform/plan.out
terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform/accesskey.txt
terraform/logs/
terraform/.claude/
terraform/.tenants/
terraform/ansible/inventory/hosts.yml

# --- portal: keep sources, drop deps/build output/local env ---
# NOTE both env files. `portal/.env` is the COMPOSE env and is created by
# portal/deploy.sh BEFORE it runs `docker compose build` — so on every run
# after the first it exists and would be copied into the image by
# `COPY portal/ /app/portal/`, baking the platform's Alibaba Cloud credentials
# and the JWT signing key into a layer. The Dockerfile carries a positive
# build-time guard for this too, because missing one line here is silent.
portal/.env
portal/backend/.env
portal/backend/.venv/
portal/backend/*.db
portal/backend/*.db-wal
portal/backend/*.db-shm
portal/frontend/node_modules/
portal/frontend/dist/
portal/e2e/node_modules/
portal/e2e/test-results/
portal/e2e/playwright-report/
# netbird artifacts are bind-mounted at runtime, never baked (192 MB + 59 MB)
portal/artifacts/

# --- deploy/ stack secrets ---
# Nothing COPYs these, so they cannot reach a layer — but the context is still
# shipped to the builder, and a remote/buildx builder would receive the
# operator's Caddy/TLS material and mynet .env.
deploy/.env
deploy/certs/
deploy/images/
deploy/state/

# --- misc ---
docs/
logs/
.playwright-mcp/
.superpowers/
.claude/
**/*.Zone.Identifier
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.retry
